sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Scheduler
    participant A as Agent Runner
    participant CA as Cost Agent
    participant DB as Platform Data
    participant AQ as Approval Queue
    participant NR as Notification Router
    participant H as Human Approver
    participant RA as Remediation Agent
    participant CLD as Cloud API
    participant AL as Audit Log

    S->>A: Trigger scheduled run (nightly 01:00)
    A->>CA: Initialize Cost Optimization Agent
    CA->>DB: Fetch billing data (30-day window)
    CA->>DB: Fetch utilization metrics (all compute)
    CA->>DB: Fetch resource inventory + tags
    DB-->>CA: Data returned

    Note over CA: Agent reasons over data:<br/>- Detect anomalies<br/>- Calculate rightsizing<br/>- Score by confidence × savings

    CA->>DB: Store recommendations (Level 1)
    CA->>NR: Send recommendation summary to FinOps Lead

    Note over H: FinOps Lead reviews recommendations

    H->>AQ: Approve rightsizing for i-0abc123 (t3.xlarge → t3.large)
    AQ->>AL: Log approval event (user, timestamp, action)

    AQ->>RA: Initialize Remediation Agent with approved action
    RA->>DB: Fetch current resource state (pre-snapshot)
    RA->>DB: Generate rollback plan
    RA->>CLD: Execute: modify_instance_type(i-0abc123, t3.large)
    CLD-->>RA: Success response

    RA->>CLD: Verify: describe_instance(i-0abc123)
    CLD-->>RA: Instance type = t3.large ✓

    RA->>DB: Store after-state
    RA->>DB: Update recommendation status = executed
    RA->>AL: Log execution record (steps, before/after, outcome)
    RA->>NR: Send completion notification

    Note over AL: Immutable record:<br/>- Recommendation data<br/>- Human approval<br/>- Execution steps<br/>- Verification result
